+    /**
+     * Collects one bounded, read-only snapshot for every GUI tooltip.
+     *
+     * <p>Entity and block-entity scans are shared by all icons so opening the inventory never repeats the expensive
+     * traversal for each item. Detailed command output remains separate and is only produced after a click.</p>
+     */
